module SiblingEnvs
  summary size: π1 R, π1⟨Tree⟩#Node.0 R, π1⟨Tree⟩#Node.1 R, π1⟨Tree⟩#Node.2 R
  summary mkH: π1 RA; res [*]◇ condition(fresh1){shared} fresh501◦, [*]◇⟨◇⟩◇ π1, fresh2{shared}
  summary mkP: π1 RA; res [*]◇ condition(fresh1){shared}, [*]◇⟨◇⟩◇ π1, fresh2{shared}
  summary mkR: π1 RA; res [*]◇ condition(fresh1){shared} fresh501◦, [*]◇⟨◇⟩◇ π1, fresh2{shared}
  summary mkU: π1 RA; res [*]◇ condition(fresh1){shared}, [*]◇⟨◇⟩◇ π1, fresh2{shared}
  summary mkS: π1 RA, π2 RA; res [*]◇ condition(fresh1){sep π1 π2} fresh501◦, [*]◇⟨◇⟩◇ π1 π2, fresh2{excl π1, excl π2, sep π1 π2}
  summary mkT: π1 R, π1#Node.0 RA, π1#Node.1 RA; res [*]◇ condition(fresh1){sep π1#Node.0 π1#Node.1} fresh501◦, [*]◇⟨◇⟩◇ π1#Node.0 π1#Node.1, fresh2{excl π1#Node.0, excl π1#Node.1, sep π1#Node.0 π1#Node.1}r{excl π1#Node.0}
  demands 0: accepted 0 (fresh 0, call 0, param 0, callback-param 0, once 0, entry 0; assumed 0), pending 0, rejected 0
  records 0: accepted 0, pending 0, rejected 0 (copy 0, restructure 0); hoisted 0, eager reads 1
total 0: accepted 0 (fresh 0, call 0, param 0, callback-param 0, once 0, entry 0; assumed 0), pending 0, rejected 0
